t and if that song doesn't hit  you in the fields i'm not sure what will  now the new album sees casey reuniting  with her golden hour producers daniel  tashian and ian fitchuk and in the  extensive rolling stone piece the trio  painted a diverse portrait of the album  with casey explaining looking at the  list of songs we have some that venture  into like a bill withers land we've got  that synth stuff that we always love and  we've got some eagles or america  territory there's a little bit of a  dance box  [Music]  and in the june july issue of owl  magazine casey confirmed the project  would include 15 tracks sharing this new  album that i'm getting ready to put out  is very very personal to me i had a lot  of fun exploring myself and my emotions  in some different ways than i have  before so i'm excited to share those and  casey definitely kept fans on their toes  finally sharing the album announcement  on social media on august 23rd in  addition the space cowboy singer also  released a trailer for a film starring  herself which will accompany the album  and stream on paramount plus on  september 10th  [Music]  the 50-minute visual will also feature  cameos by eugene levy drag race winner  simone princess nokia victoria pedretti  and meg stalter and more recently casey  gave fans another glimpse of the new  album sharing a second song titled  justified along with the accompanying  music video which sees her driving along  an open road crying as she remembers a  past lover  [Applause]  that alone just gets me so excited to  hear the rest now casey recently shared  a snippet of the 15 songs on social  media and told apple music zayn low she  describes the project as a modern  tragedy in three acts which definitely  comes through after looking at the track  list so there appears to be some  nostalgic and sad songs towards the  beginning with if this was a movie and  simple times but towards the end things  appear to be looking up on songs like  what doesn't kill me and there is a  light so what songs are you most excited  to hear on star crossed let us know in  the comments below
 

